Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Saturn: sidebar phase 3 - spaces, Pinned list

Spaces are profiles, so each space has its own cookies, favorites (pinned
tabs) and Pinned list. The sidebar shows the space name above the
favorites, the space's Pinned list (bookmark folder Other bookmarks/Pinned;
click opens or switches to the page, right-click removes) above the Clear
divider, and a bottom bar with downloads, one dot per space (click switches:
the target space's window takes this window's place) and + (new space via
the profile picker). Tabs get an 'Add to Pinned list' context menu item.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
